DOC = """StoMA topic 21 (absorption). F1 picture: a chase. Each lap the gap from Max to the car ahead shrinks or grows by one step until he overtakes (A) or falls out of DRS range and gives up (B); both ends are absorbing. Pattern waiting times stay coin-based, framed as laps quicker or slower than the last."""
